 exceed suggested use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"As with any supplement, if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"100% Naturally Sourced\nfrom Grapes, Blueberries, Raspberries, Plums, Carrots and Tomatoes\nAntioxidant Properties to Support:\n{images: DNA and fruits/veggies}\nCell Protection*  General Health*\nSee side panel for more information\nActual Size"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Adults - Take two MiniTabs daily with food."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not formulated for use in children.\nKeep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature. Keep bottle tightly closed. Protect from moisture."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Bottle sealed with printed foil under cap. Do Not Use if foil is torn."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"What is ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie?\nNew ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie is a phytonutrient supplement from the makers of Centrum, the #1 doctor recommended multivitamin brand. It contains a blend of fruits and vegetables, 100% naturally sourced from grapes, blueberries, raspberries, plums, carrots, and tomatoes.\nWhy take ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie?\nEach MiniTab of ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie harnesses the power equal to a serving of a blend of fruits and vegetables. The convenient MiniTabs are an easy way to supplement your diet. Take ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie on it's own or as a complement to your multivitamin and as part of a diet rich in fruits and vegetables.\nFor more information on ProNutrients Fruit & Veggie and other ProNutrients supplements, please visit www.ProNutrients.com.\nBased on the average ORAC values for the top 10 most commonly consumed fruits and vegetables in the US. ORAC measures the antioxidant capacity of fruits and vegetables. This product is not intended to replace your daily intake of fruit and vegetables."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Made in Canada"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"(c) 2011 Pfizer Inc."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"PAA020405"}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"3 0005-7600-90 2","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}